==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Tabantha Wheat can be collected by cutting grass in the [[Tabantha Frontier]]. Alternatively, it can be purchased at [[The Slippery Falcon]] in [[Rito Village]] or from the [[Traveling Merchant]] [[Yammo]]. Eaten raw, Tabantha Wheat will restore one [[Heart]] to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]]. Tabantha Wheat is one of the ingredients that can be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make Light Yellow [[Dye]]. It is grown on the [[Tabantha Plains]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

